NP测定、心电图及超声心动图。治疗期内第4周访视采集NT-proBNP；第12周访视进行主要终点全套评估。安全性评估涵盖生命体征、心电图及实验室检查异常。特别关注的不良事件包括严重低血钾（血钾<3.0mmol/L），治疗期间需监测血钾水平。完整的实验室检查套餐（如血常规、血生化、肝功能、肾功能、电解质、凝血功能、尿常规等）及各访视具体采集清单尚未在现有资料中逐项列出。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：V1访视列出'实验室、NT-proBNP、心电图、超声心动图'；V3列出NT-proBNP；安全性终点提及'实验室检查异常'；特别关注不良事件定义含血钾<3.0mmol/L阈值。但完整实验室检查项目清单（具体检测项目、各访视采集时点、正常值范围）未在允许来源中逐项给出，不能由'实验室'泛称或安全性终点描述推断具体检查项目。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_623f81608f82a81f","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9e2c3308f90211956b5eea0b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"537926e7a4b803ce62ae8e7cc9f68d79bd5fbf4238e48401649d9278ae0bf10a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_5922bd5fc9a7960d:full-draft:9e2c3308f90211956b5eea0b","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9e2c3308f90211956b5eea0b","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:7c91e7c1f7976522b36f466f3ccd4e65739d7618408eef192af66168a0786719:9e2c3308f90211956b5eea0b","text_sha256":"537926e7a4b803ce62ae8e7cc9f68d79bd5fbf4238e48401649d9278ae0bf10a"},{"content_sha256":"b27186fa03b5e482bdf4807db173a2025f3ebf4adf1f98851cc1c0f8fdd214a1","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","text_sha256":"b27186fa03b5e482bdf4807db173a2025f3ebf4adf1f98851cc1c0f8fdd214a1"}]}